{"id":1102511,"xmlId":"com.intellij.spring.boot","name":"Spring Boot","description":"<p>Adds navigation, auto-completion, and inspections specific to <a href=\"https://spring.io/projects/spring-boot\">Spring Boot</a>.</p>\n    <p>Features:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Coding assistance</strong>: Code completion, inspections, gutter icons, and quick fixes for Spring Boot annotations and configuration classes, including Spring EL support inside conditional configuration expressions.</li>\n      <li><strong>Configuration files</strong>: Completion, validation, and navigation for keys and values in application.properties and application.yml, including custom keys defined in additional configuration metadata.</li>\n      <li><strong>Run configuration</strong>: A dedicated run configuration for Spring Boot applications; the Ultimate edition adds live insight into beans, health, environment, and autoconfiguration conditions.</li>\n      <li><strong>Datasource integration</strong>: Create or open a database connection directly from datasource properties or YAML keys, with driver-dependency inspections.</li>\n      <li><strong>Database migrations</strong>: Recognizes Flyway and Liquibase configuration to resolve the datasource, changelog locations, and schema, with navigation to migration files.</li>\n      <li><strong>Scheduling</strong>: Completion, validation, and documentation for Spring's cron expression syntax in scheduled methods and in configuration files.</li>\n      <li><strong>Spring MVC integration</strong>: Recognizes Boot's autoconfigured view resolvers, static web resources, and API versioning properties.</li>\n      <li><strong>Spring Data JPA</strong>: Shows the resolved query for a Spring Data repository method, and completes Hibernate configuration keys.</li>\n    </ul>","organization":"JetBrains s.r.o.","tags":["Framework"],"version":"262.8665.176","dependencies":["intellij.java.backend","com.intellij.modules.jetbrains"],"optionalDependencies":["com.i